  "notes": [
    "**Ayudar** is a regular **-AR verb**",
    "No spelling changes or stem changes",
    "Past participle: **ayudado** (regular)",
    "Often used with \"a\" + person/infinitive: *ayudar a alguien* (to help someone), *ayudar a estudiar* (to help study)",
